[ALERT] Reversal shortfall — Gift card #<%= @gift_card.id %>
======================================================

Gift card ID:            #<%= @gift_card.id %> (<%= @gift_card.merchant&.store_name %>)
Reversal transaction ID: #<%= @reversal_transaction_id %>
Shortfall:               <%= @amount_formatted %>

A merchant reversed a redemption, but the load(s) it originally debited had
been refunded or written off in the meantime, so the cents could not go
back where they came from. An admin_adjustment load was created on the
card for the shortfall. Review the card's loads in the admin panel.
